                "topic": "Section I: Part A (No Calculator)",
                "difficulty": "medium",
                "question": "<p>At time <em>t</em> ≥ 0, a\r                             particle moving along the <em>xy</em>-plane has a velocity vector given by\r                                 <img src=\"images/80be6457b2d248f78d1972c806fd9e6f.png\" class=\"exam-img\" style=\"max-width:100%; vertical-align:middle; margin:4px 0;\">. What is the acceleration vector of the particle?</p>",
